  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「あのですね。パパ……じゃなくて、転校生の先輩」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「ん～、まぁいいかパパで。ふたりっきりで、他に誰もいないし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「いちいち言い直すの面倒ですし、いいですよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「それはともかく。パパ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「いちおう仮にも女の子を休日に呼びだしておいて『自転車を貸してほしい』ってどうかと思いますよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「すごくガッカリです、残念です。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「相手がわたしじゃなければ、引っぱたかれても文句言えませんよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「パパは、仕方ないひとだなぁ。乙女心がわかってません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「わたし、いろいろ変な想像しちゃったじゃないですか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「わたし、『自転車のおまけ』じゃないんですけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「まぁ、いいです。パパが、わたしの自転車を気にいってくれたのは嬉しいですから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「いいですよね、自転車。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「ドラムいじるのと似たような感じで、整備したり改造したりの楽しさがあって……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「しかも乗れば遠くまで行けるし、運動にもなるし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「至れり尽くせりです、自転車とドラムを発明したひとは真に評価すべき偉人だと思います」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「わたし、思った以上に『好き』になってます。自転車、もう生活のいちぶです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「好きなものがあると、人生は薔薇色ですね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「でもパパ、勝手にわたしの自転車を動かすのはやめてくださいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「こないだ、『駅伝大会』のとき勝手に使ったでしょう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「鍵かけてなかったわたしもよくないんですけど、親しき仲にも礼儀ありですよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「二度はないですからね、気をつけてくださいね。わかってるのかなぁ、このひとは？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「ほんと、うちの学校の先輩たちはどうしてこう常識とか落っことしてるんだろ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「とにかく。わたしの知らないところで、わたしの自転車が勝手に扱われるのは我慢できません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「わたしの自転車でどこ行くつもりか知りませんが……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「休日ですし、わたしも同行していいですよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「いいでしょう、そのぐらい。暇なんですよ。軽音部は休みですし、自宅にもいづらいし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「せっかくですし、ね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「うん、決まりですね。じゃあ出発しましょう、パパ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「自転車はパパが運転してくださいね、わたしは後ろに乗せてもらいます。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「パパに、ぎゅって抱きついて……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「当然でしょう。わたし、パパがどこ行こうとしてるのか知りませんし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「目的地もわかんないのに、運転できないですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「自転車は一台しかないですしね、ふたり乗りするしかないでしょう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「いきなり休日に呼びつけただけでは飽きたらず、さらに女の子に重労働させるつもりですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「よいしょ、っと。準備できました、きりきり漕いでください。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「出発進行、よ～そろ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「ん～、変な感じ。パパと、ふたりで休日デートかぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「どんな一日になるんでしょうね、ちょっとワクワクします」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「冒険も、『好き』かもしれません。わたし、嗜好が男の子っぽいかなぁ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
